<title>SWEDEN: Perstorp, India's Aegis in venture.</title>
<headline>Perstorp, India's Aegis in venture.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish chemicals company Perstorp said on Tuesday it signed a preliminary ageement with Aegis Chemical Industries Ltd to set up a speciality chemical products joint venture in Vapi in India.</p>
</text>
